 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The structure sein zu + Infinitiv and its passive modal value",
     "texto": [
      "The combination of the conjugated auxiliary **sein + zu + infinitive of a transitive verb** is a formal periphrastic alternative to the passive voice expressing **strict obligation** (equivalent to *müssen + passive*: **Die Rechnung ist bis Freitag zu begleichen**) or, depending on the context or with negation, **possibility or impossibility** (equivalent to *können + passive*: **Der Schaden ist nicht mehr zu beheben**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Subject and linguistic register",
     "texto": [
      "The grammatical subject of the construction corresponds to the object of the action (identical to the subject of the regular passive voice). This construction is extraordinarily common in normative texts, tenancy agreements, court rulings and technical instructions for its elegant conciseness."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Form",
     "columnas": [
